        SCHOOL_ABILITY "Way of the Void" {
            "When you make a check using your Void Ring, after rolling dice, you may receive a number of fatigue up to your school rank. If you do, you may pull or push:\n\nIf you pull, choose a number of dice with non-blank results equal to the fatigue you received, and alter each to a blank result.\n\nIf you push, choose a number of dice with blank results equal to the fatigue you received, and alter each to a non-blank result of your choice."
        }

        MASTERY_ABILITY ^"Essence of Emptiness" {
            "Once per scene, after a character rolls dice, you may receive 3 fatigue to alter any number of their rolled dice to blank results."
        }
