            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Magnitude 1+: When a target is dealt strife, one other target of your choice may receive that strife instead.\n\nMagnitude 3+: Choose a ring or skill. When any target makes a check using that ring or skill, they may use any other target's rank in that ring or skill instead of their own."
